  "title": "Mimi's Curried Hawaiian Chicken Salad",
  "description": "Colorful and fragrant, this chicken salad makes a super summer supper. Best served the day after making, it's beautiful if served in pineapple 'boats' or a halved cantaloupe or honeydew.",
  "authors": [
    "LEGALPEACH"
